SOLUTION 1
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
    pH 7 charge
SOLUTION 2
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 7 charge
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -file output.sel
    -temperature
    -step
USER_PUNCH 1
    -headings rho
    10 PUNCH RHO
END
